        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruac kɛ kui̱ locä nath muundiɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Riɛk akɛ yiëën deet tin ci det nɛɛnikä riaw kä dɔɔr!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ cu Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa ni Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl nɛmɛ lar kɛ kui̱ yiëëni deet tin yiënkɛ nɛɛkä wee i̱, “Ci yɛn detkä riaw dɔɔr, kä ci yɛn kɛ buath raar, kä /ken yɛn kɛ tit. Kä nɛ̈nɛ jɛ ɣän bä yɛ tit kɛ kui̱ lät jiäknikun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän bä duɔth deetkä ma̱a̱t rɛy wi̱i̱ni diaal tin cäkɛ riaw kä thi̱n, bä kɛ luɔ̱c guäth lo̱kdiɛn, kä bikɛ rɔ kuay ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bä kɛ moc yiëën ti bikɛ tit, kä thilɛ mi bi lɛ dual kɛ kɛ, kiɛ mi bi kɛ jak kä ga̱y, kä thilɛ mi bi lɛ bath, ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Ci gua̱th thia̱k, mi bä kaar mi gɔaa jiɛc kä Dee-bid thi̱n, mi bi ruëc ala kuäär kä bɛ lät kɛ pɛl, kä bɛ thuɔ̱k kɛnɛ cuŋ lat rɛy rööl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rɛy ni̱nikɛ ba Juda kän kä bi I-thɛ-rɛl cieŋ kɛ mal. Kä ba ciötdɛ cɔl i̱, ‘Kuoth Nhial ɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋda.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Nɛnɛ ci ni̱n cop tin /ci naath bi lɛ ya̱c thi̱n i̱, ‘Ce̱tnikɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial in tëk mëë no̱o̱ŋ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl raar ro̱o̱l I-jëp,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "duundɛ ɣöö bikɛ wee i̱, ‘Ce̱tnikɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial in tëk mëë no̱o̱ŋ kuay dhɔaar I-thɛ-rɛl kä bo̱th kɛ raar muun kuec caam kɛnɛ wi̱i̱ diaal tëë cä kɛ naŋ thi̱n.’ Kä bikɛ cu cieŋ muundiɛn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ga̱k göökni ka̱a̱cni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa wee i̱, “/Cu ruac göökni tɔ̱ bi ji̱ la̱t ruac go̱o̱kä mɔ liŋ, tɔ̱ ba ji̱ thiäŋ kɛ ŋa̱th kä mi thil luɔt tɔ̱. Lat kɛn ni nyuuthni cärädiɛn, /ci kɛ ti bä raar thok Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "La kɛn nɛy tin lökɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial a jio̱k i̱, ‘Bɛ gɔaa kɛ yɛ,’ kä jiökɛ nɛy tin bum wuɔ̱thkiɛn kä guɔ̱ɔ̱rkɛ ni cär lo̱cnikiɛn i̱, ‘Thilɛ riɛk mi bi yɛ jek.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Ɛ ɣän Kuoth mi te thiekä, a /ci mua Kuoth mi te nänä? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A dee raan rɔ ku tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ guäth mi /ca ŋäc mi cä jɛ dee nɛn thi̱n? Kä /ci ɣän nhial kɛnɛ piny ku thiäŋ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän cä ruac göökni liŋ tin latkɛ ruaacni go̱o̱kä ka̱a̱cni kɛ ciötdä, wä kɛ i̱, ‘Ɣän cä läk läkikä, cä läk läkikä!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bɛ ku mäni nɛy bɛ te lo̱cni göökni ka̱a̱cni ti latkɛ ruaacni ka̱a̱cni go̱o̱kä kɛ cär lo̱cnikiɛn ɔ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tin car kɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö dëë nɛɛkä jak kä pa̱lkɛ ciötdä ruëëc kɛ la̱a̱kiɛn tin lät kɛn kɛ kä rɔ̱, ce̱tkɛ mëë ci gua̱ni ciötdä pa̱l ruëëc kɛ kui̱ kuɔth Baal? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ gök in tekɛ la̱k lat la̱a̱kdɛ, kä ɛ ram in kääp ruacdä lat jɛ kɛ thuɔ̱kdɛ. Ɛŋu mɔ dee jil te kɛɛl kɛ bɛl ɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ci ruacdä ku ce̱tkɛ mac, kɛnɛ dey in la päm a tiath ni ŋëëtni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, ɣän gakä kɛ go̱o̱k tin ca ruacdiɛn jak kä ruacdä kamnikiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛnɛ, ɣän gakä kɛ go̱o̱k tin lat kɛ ruacdiɛn kä bikɛ wee i̱, ‘Ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän gakä kɛ nɛy tin latkɛ ruac go̱o̱kä kɛnɛ la̱a̱k kacä, lät kɛn nikɛ ka̱a̱cni, kä buathkɛ nɛɛkä raar kɛ ka̱a̱cnikiɛn kɛnɛ nyɔɔpdiɛn, kä /ka̱n kɛ ja̱k kä /ka̱n kɛ kuany. Kä thilɛ luɔt mi ci nɛy ti̱ti̱ jɛ jëk thi̱n, ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naath kɛ ɣa̱c mi thiɛk kä Kuoth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mi wä raan ji̱ thiec kä kɛn nɛy ti̱ti̱, mi ɛ gök kiɛ ɛ bo̱o̱th palä i̱, ‘Ɣa̱c Kuɔth Nhial in thiɛk ɛ lee ŋu?’ Bikɛ loc i̱, ‘Ɣa̱c mi thiɛk ŋu kä, kä ɣän bä yɛ yiäk.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱ go̱kä kiɛ bo̱o̱th palä kiɛ ram kɛl kä naath mɔ bi wee i̱, ‘Ɣa̱c Kuɔth Nhial mi thiɛk ɔ,’ ɣän bä ɛn ram ɛmɔ duäc kɛnɛ ji̱ dhɔaarɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛmɛ ɛ jɛn min bi yɛn ɛ lat kamnikun, bi ram ɔ jɛ la̱t gua̱n thieekädɛ kä bi ram ɔ jɛ la̱t däman i̱, ‘Ɛŋu la luɔc Kuɔth Nhial ɔ?’ Kiɛ ‘Ɛŋu ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ lat ɔ?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö /cia rɔ̱ bi nyɔk kɛ ruac i̱, ‘Ɣa̱c Kuɔth Nhial in thiɛk’ kɛ ɣöö ɣa̱c in thiɛk ɛ riet ran, kä cia rieet Kuɔth in tëk ni Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa ni Kuothdan ya̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛmɛ ɛ min bi thiec ni gök i̱, ‘Kuoth Nhial cɛ ji̱ loc i̱di?’ Kiɛ ‘Ɛŋu mi ci Kuoth Nhial jɛ lat?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö mi wi̱i̱ jɛ jiök i̱, ‘Ɣa̱c Kuɔth Nhial mi thiɛk,’ ɛ jɛn min ci Kuoth Nhial jɛ lar, kä kɛ ɣöö ci rieet ti̱ti̱ lat i̱, ‘Ɣa̱c Kuɔth Nhial mi thiɛk,’ kä cä yɛ jiök i̱, ‘/Cuarɛ wee i̱, “Ɣa̱c Kuɔth Nhial mi thiɛk.” ’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, kɛ thuɔ̱k ɣän bä yɛ pa̱l ruëëc kä bä yɛ yuɔr raar nhiamdä, kɛɛl kɛ wec ëë cä ka̱m yɛ kɛnɛ guurikun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
